1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire
Knight of the Ribbon

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Knight of the Ribbon,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Twenty-Seventh Episode
Magic Water
Hurry! Black Cloud Island

15
00:02:53,250 --> 00:02:55,740
<i>I was tricked by that Tink doll and thrown down a valley.</i>

16
00:02:56,570 --> 00:03:01,120
<i>And there, that foul smoke blinded me.</i>

17
00:03:02,723 --> 00:03:06,673
<i>When I returned to the castle, an impostor was in my place.</i>

18
00:03:08,624 --> 00:03:09,624
I can't just sit back and wait!

19
00:03:10,140 --> 00:03:12,480
No matter what, I will expose this scheme!

20
00:03:12,820 --> 00:03:15,260
And Father and Mother...

21
00:03:19,446 --> 00:03:20,013
Who's there?!

22
00:03:24,371 --> 00:03:25,700
That voice... Mephisto!

23
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:26,686
That's right.

24
00:03:26,849 --> 00:03:29,386
Today, I will finally take your boy's heart!

25
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:30,940
It's useless, useless!

26
00:03:33,306 --> 00:03:36,140
Don't you want to know where your father and mother are?

27
00:03:37,380 --> 00:03:38,380
Father and Mother?

28
00:03:39,184 --> 00:03:42,180
I see... You kidnapped them, didn't you?!

29
00:03:42,394 --> 00:03:44,626
Speak! Where are my parents?!

30
00:03:45,144 --> 00:03:46,680
I'll tell you...

31
00:03:47,195 --> 00:03:50,820
...if you come to my lair and trade your boy's heart for them.

32
00:03:51,300 --> 00:03:52,300
Zuborasha!

33
00:03:56,920 --> 00:03:59,860
Ishi no tsuru yo, waga yama de tobe!
- O Stone crane, fly to my mountain!

34
00:04:30,550 --> 00:04:31,646
Where am I?

35
00:04:31,765 --> 00:04:32,926
My home.

36
00:04:33,844 --> 00:04:34,520
Tell me.

37
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:36,026
Where are my parents?

38
00:04:36,086 --> 00:04:36,580
Very well.

39
00:04:36,753 --> 00:04:37,313
A promise is a promise.

40
00:04:37,505 --> 00:04:40,120
I'll tell you. Those two are on Sea Snake Island.

41
00:04:41,280 --> 00:04:42,280
Sea Snake Island?

42
00:04:42,820 --> 00:04:43,299
That's right.

43
00:04:43,580 --> 00:04:46,390
They're staying quiet there without making a sound.

44
00:04:46,414 --> 00:04:47,646
What do you mean by that?

45
00:04:48,640 --> 00:04:50,240
They've both been turned to stone.

46
00:04:51,095 --> 00:04:55,416
With my full power, they've become stone that can't move a single hair.

47
00:04:56,520 --> 00:04:58,446
Father and Mother... turned to stone?

48
00:05:00,540 --> 00:05:01,540
Demon!

49
00:05:01,715 --> 00:05:02,920
Untie my ropes!

50
00:05:03,200 --> 00:05:04,579
I'm going to Sea Snake Island!

51
00:05:04,675 --> 00:05:08,920
Fine. After I transfer your boy's heart to Hecate.

52
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:09,743
Hey,

53
00:05:09,954 --> 00:05:10,686
Hecate!

54
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,360
Hecate!

55
00:05:14,405 --> 00:05:15,706
Hey, Hecate!

56
00:05:16,095 --> 00:05:17,633
Answer me, Hecate!

57
00:05:18,455 --> 00:05:19,993
Come out, Hecate!

58
00:05:20,605 --> 00:05:23,306
Why do you hate taking the boy's heart so much?

59
00:05:27,080 --> 00:05:28,230
Father,

60
00:05:28,854 --> 00:05:29,603
Mother,

61
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:30,840
I'm sorry.

62
00:05:31,310 --> 00:05:35,000
My strength as Sapphire isn't enough to save you.

63
00:05:35,730 --> 00:05:38,140
If only I could see...

64
00:05:39,225 --> 00:05:40,660
But there's no time.

65
00:05:41,145 --> 00:05:42,680
Mephisto will be back soon.

66
00:05:43,165 --> 00:05:44,580
Hecate, where are you?

67
00:05:45,260 --> 00:05:46,393
Zubarasha!

68
00:05:51,300 --> 00:05:53,100
Hecate, come over here!

69
00:05:53,685 --> 00:05:54,720
Answer me!

70
00:05:55,250 --> 00:05:56,250
Hecate, where are you?

71
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:57,686
Where are you hiding?

72
00:05:57,795 --> 00:05:59,220
Answer me!

73
00:06:00,860 --> 00:06:03,906
I see, you must be hiding in one of these jars.

74
00:06:10,145 --> 00:06:12,006
I've got you, Hecate.

75
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:13,980
Be a good girl and come out.

76
00:06:14,430 --> 00:06:17,720
Hecate, listen to your papa.

77
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:21,300
I'm sorry, Papa.

78
00:06:21,760 --> 00:06:23,580
Come on, Hecate, open the lid.

79
00:06:23,925 --> 00:06:25,340
I won't send you away, so come out.

80
00:06:25,810 --> 00:06:26,810
Be a good girl.

81
00:06:27,075 --> 00:06:29,500
I know you're hiding inside this jar.

82
00:06:32,319 --> 00:06:33,426
Thank you, Hecate.

83
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:35,320
You saved me again.

84
00:06:36,780 --> 00:06:38,066
Hurry and get ready to run.

85
00:06:38,460 --> 00:06:39,238
Come on, hurry.

86
00:06:39,262 --> 00:06:42,593
I made sure the lid won't open, but Papa will come straight here as soon as he realizes.

87
00:06:42,630 --> 00:06:43,630
Please, Hecate.

88
00:06:43,805 --> 00:06:45,000
Papa is begging you.

89
00:06:45,150 --> 00:06:46,150
Please come out.

90
00:06:46,265 --> 00:06:49,560
I can't even break the jar with magic while you're inside. Come on.

91
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:09,080
Hang in there, Sapphire.

92
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:11,420
Just make it to where the ship is.

93
00:07:18,890 --> 00:07:22,273
I wish I could heal your eyes, but it's beyond my power.

94
00:07:22,835 --> 00:07:25,920
Just taking me to Sea Snake Island is enough.

95
00:07:43,380 --> 00:07:44,380
We're almost at the ship.

96
00:07:44,525 --> 00:07:45,525
Hang on.

97
00:07:49,900 --> 00:07:52,160
Alright, we have to get to Sea Snake Island before Papa comes.

98
00:07:59,090 --> 00:08:00,740
Papa's probably furious right about now.

99
00:08:08,810 --> 00:08:11,700
Oh, did I drift off?

100
00:08:15,760 --> 00:08:19,623
Thank goodness. I was worried we lost our way while I was asleep, but we're fine.

101
00:08:19,647 --> 00:08:21,000
Hecate, have we reached Sea Snake Island?

102
00:08:21,025 --> 00:08:22,060
No, not yet.

103
00:08:22,505 --> 00:08:24,806
I can't wait to see my father and mother.

104
00:08:25,165 --> 00:08:26,353
We're almost there, Sapphire.

105
00:08:36,779 --> 00:08:37,880
Sapphire, look! Sea Snake Island!

106
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,620
So, we've finally arrived.

107
00:08:40,100 --> 00:08:41,340
Hold on to the boat! Hold tight!

108
00:08:41,710 --> 00:08:43,700
The island is surrounded by treacherous whirlpools.

109
00:08:43,945 --> 00:08:45,780
If we get caught in one, we're done for!

110
00:09:22,169 --> 00:09:22,972
Hecate!

111
00:09:22,996 --> 00:09:24,386
Hecate, where are you?!

112
00:09:24,669 --> 00:09:25,763
Hecate!

113
00:09:26,340 --> 00:09:27,640
That was close.

114
00:09:28,285 --> 00:09:29,425
Sapphire, are you okay?

115
00:09:29,680 --> 00:09:30,086
Yeah.

116
00:09:30,415 --> 00:09:32,780
That was rough, but we made it to Sea Snake Island.

117
00:09:33,780 --> 00:09:34,366
This is it?

118
00:09:34,620 --> 00:09:35,620
Then where are my parents?

119
00:09:35,840 --> 00:09:37,619
They should be somewhere on this island.

120
00:09:44,639 --> 00:09:45,953
Sapphire, hide!

121
00:09:46,819 --> 00:09:48,093
What's wrong, Hecate?

122
00:09:49,260 --> 00:09:51,800
Quiet. It's the sea snakes that lives on this island.

123
00:09:52,165 --> 00:09:53,420
If they spot us, we're done for.

124
00:10:06,009 --> 00:10:06,653
Sapphire!

125
00:10:06,703 --> 00:10:08,363
Don't let it pull you! Cut it down!

126
00:10:12,646 --> 00:10:14,153
Sapphire, above you!

127
00:10:17,569 --> 00:10:19,060
Get away from there, fast!

128
00:10:26,209 --> 00:10:27,913
Hang in there!

129
00:10:28,580 --> 00:10:29,326
Almost there!

130
00:10:35,139 --> 00:10:36,340
Sapphire, I found them!

131
00:10:36,460 --> 00:10:38,219
Your father and mother!

132
00:10:39,539 --> 00:10:40,539
W-Where, Hecate?

133
00:10:42,039 --> 00:10:43,740
This is your mother, Sapphire.

134
00:10:47,140 --> 00:10:47,880
Th-This is...?

135
00:10:48,359 --> 00:10:50,446
This cold touch... is my mother?

136
00:10:50,525 --> 00:10:52,073
M-Mother!

137
00:10:53,819 --> 00:10:54,986
Come on, tell me!

138
00:10:55,260 --> 00:10:56,806
How do we break this spell?

139
00:10:57,630 --> 00:11:00,646
One way is for my father to undo it.

140
00:11:01,045 --> 00:11:02,045
That's obvious!

141
00:11:02,219 --> 00:11:03,680
I'm asking you because he won't!

142
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:05,046
And the other way is to...

143
00:11:05,070 --> 00:11:08,353
pour all the blood of the person who loves them most over them.

144
00:11:08,620 --> 00:11:09,080
What?!

145
00:11:09,485 --> 00:11:10,485
Every last drop of my blood?

146
00:11:11,379 --> 00:11:14,480
I love Father and Mother more than anyone!

147
00:11:15,265 --> 00:11:18,640
So if I cover them in my blood, the spell will break?

148
00:11:19,770 --> 00:11:21,260
But you can't do that!

149
00:11:22,165 --> 00:11:23,165
Yes I can!

150
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:24,360
I can do it!

151
00:11:25,039 --> 00:11:28,900
Father, Mother, my blood will break this demon's curse!

152
00:11:29,026 --> 00:11:29,733
No, stop!

153
00:11:29,786 --> 00:11:30,240
Sapphire!

154
00:11:30,520 --> 00:11:32,199
You'll die if you do that!

155
00:11:32,490 --> 00:11:33,100
Sapphire!

156
00:11:33,101 --> 00:11:33,740
Let go of me!

157
00:11:34,060 --> 00:11:35,060
Sapphire!

158
00:11:35,340 --> 00:11:36,113
<i>Hecate!</i>

159
00:11:36,740 --> 00:11:37,406
<i>Hecate!</i>

160
00:11:37,700 --> 00:11:38,700
Papa!

161
00:11:42,520 --> 00:11:43,520
Mephisto?

162
00:11:44,280 --> 00:11:44,880
Sapphire!

163
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:45,753
Watch out!

164
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:48,720
Sapphire!

165
00:11:54,790 --> 00:11:55,896
Sapphire!

166
00:11:58,283 --> 00:11:59,896
Father!

167
00:12:00,056 --> 00:12:01,970
Mother!

168
00:12:16,480 --> 00:12:21,186
Throw this corpse into the sea to feed the fish!

169
00:12:21,944 --> 00:12:23,820
Wait, he's still alive!

170
00:12:26,420 --> 00:12:29,480
He must have escaped from some island!

171
00:12:29,560 --> 00:12:31,140
We don't want to get involved in any trouble!

172
00:12:31,385 --> 00:12:32,480
Throw him into the sea!

173
00:12:32,875 --> 00:12:35,773
Unlucky bastard—just when he was almost saved!

174
00:12:39,180 --> 00:12:40,180
Hey, wait!

175
00:12:41,490 --> 00:12:42,560
Put him down, Bond!

176
00:12:42,945 --> 00:12:44,453
Aye aye, Captain!

177
00:12:45,005 --> 00:12:48,400
Silver, I won't let you give orders on my ship!

178
00:12:49,439 --> 00:12:51,560
I'll look into it. Put them in the war room!

179
00:13:18,599 --> 00:13:21,560
Never thought I'd see you in a place like this.

180
00:13:22,155 --> 00:13:25,933
Sapphire, get a good night's sleep first so you can recover.

181
00:13:30,340 --> 00:13:31,340
Where am I?

182
00:13:31,385 --> 00:13:32,800
Oh, you're awake.

183
00:13:33,370 --> 00:13:34,506
Who's there?!

184
00:13:35,539 --> 00:13:36,800
It's me, Blood.

185
00:13:37,006 --> 00:13:38,006
Blood?

186
00:13:38,599 --> 00:13:39,880
I see. So you don't remember.

187
00:13:40,325 --> 00:13:44,000
I'm the prisoner you saved a year ago when Grand Duke Duralumin captured me.

188
00:13:44,435 --> 00:13:45,880
As you can see, I'm a pirate now.

189
00:13:47,740 --> 00:13:48,740
What happened to your eyes?

190
00:13:49,390 --> 00:13:50,420
Can't you even see my face?

191
00:13:51,280 --> 00:13:52,280
What on earth happened?

192
00:13:52,785 --> 00:13:54,140
If you're okay with me, won't you talk to me?

193
00:14:00,609 --> 00:14:03,140
There must be a pact with the Snow Queen.

194
00:14:03,217 --> 00:14:04,154
How sickening...

195
00:14:04,279 --> 00:14:07,580
Right. Word is her army will invade Silverland soon.

196
00:14:07,900 --> 00:14:09,660
Then Mephisto and my imposter...

197
00:14:10,277 --> 00:14:12,906
Yeah, most likely the Snow Queen's doing.

198
00:14:13,520 --> 00:14:15,020
That sounds just like her.

199
00:14:15,815 --> 00:14:18,873
Damn that Snow Queen! Next time I see her, I won't let her get away with this!

200
00:14:19,489 --> 00:14:22,280
But first, we need to cure your eyes.

201
00:14:22,545 --> 00:14:23,545
Cure my eyes?

202
00:14:23,620 --> 00:14:24,753
Can my sight really be restored?

203
00:14:26,749 --> 00:14:29,940
A pirate sails to ports all over the world and hears all kinds of rumors.

204
00:14:30,333 --> 00:14:31,740
One of them is about the Waterfall of Purification.

205
00:14:31,940 --> 00:14:32,940
The Waterfall of Purification?

206
00:14:33,140 --> 00:14:33,740
That's right.

207
00:14:34,260 --> 00:14:35,899
If you wash your eyes with the water from that waterfall,

208
00:14:36,404 --> 00:14:39,720
 it'll flush out the poison and restore your sight in no time.

209
00:14:39,910 --> 00:14:42,920
My eyes... I'll be able to see again!

210
00:14:44,159 --> 00:14:47,820
Getting to Black Cloud Island where the waterfall is might be dangerous,

211
00:14:47,864 --> 00:14:50,332
but with Blood around, you've got nothing to worry about.

212
00:14:51,030 --> 00:14:52,360
Blood's really gone soft.

213
00:14:52,460 --> 00:14:56,240
Real deal or not, I'm not risking my neck for a guy like him.

214
00:14:57,739 --> 00:14:58,820
You shouldn't let yourself catch a chill.

215
00:14:59,340 --> 00:15:00,340
Let's head back inside.

216
00:15:01,609 --> 00:15:03,100
Damn that Blood. Just you wait...

217
00:15:04,860 --> 00:15:06,360
You said it was dangerous...

218
00:15:07,037 --> 00:15:08,720
Ah, right, there are two treacherous spots.

219
00:15:08,950 --> 00:15:09,950
One is the Raging Rocks.

220
00:15:10,539 --> 00:15:12,020
And the Cove of the Ancient Capital.

221
00:15:12,940 --> 00:15:13,720
Raging Rocks?

222
00:15:13,910 --> 00:15:14,680
The Cove of the Ancient Capital?

223
00:15:14,850 --> 00:15:16,420
Come on, it's nothing to worry about.

224
00:15:16,889 --> 00:15:18,780
Here, drink this to warm yourself up.

225
00:15:19,220 --> 00:15:19,666
I don't want any!

226
00:15:19,750 --> 00:15:20,856
I don't drink alcohol!

227
00:15:21,615 --> 00:15:22,615
Oh right, Sapphire.

228
00:15:22,985 --> 00:15:24,520
This is what's best for you.

229
00:15:24,835 --> 00:15:26,540
I'm pretty sure I put it in here...

230
00:15:27,240 --> 00:15:30,760
Just because I saved you, why are you being so nice to me?

231
00:15:31,380 --> 00:15:34,540
Well, don't go asking weird things out of nowhere.

232
00:15:34,680 --> 00:15:35,340
Ah, here it is!

233
00:15:35,400 --> 00:15:36,026
This one.

234
00:15:37,420 --> 00:15:40,360
This suits you much better than liquor.

235
00:15:40,860 --> 00:15:43,060
W-What is this?

236
00:15:43,545 --> 00:15:44,158
A dress.

237
00:15:44,689 --> 00:15:46,780
I saved it, hoping I'd run into you again someday.

238
00:15:47,245 --> 00:15:48,080
Why don't you try it on?

239
00:15:48,081 --> 00:15:48,640
A dress?

240
00:15:48,740 --> 00:15:49,540
Don't make a fool of me!

241
00:15:49,660 --> 00:15:50,660
I'm a boy!

242
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:54,233
Sapphire, no matter how much you act like a boy, I know you're a girl.

243
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:55,320
Are you starting that again?!

244
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:57,006
All right, I get it.

245
00:15:57,031 --> 00:15:58,280
I get it, Sapphire.

246
00:15:58,920 --> 00:16:00,840
But if you ever get the chance, just once would be enough.

247
00:16:01,205 --> 00:16:02,820
Won't you wear it and show me?

248
00:16:19,580 --> 00:16:20,580
What's wrong?

249
00:16:31,719 --> 00:16:33,340
Captain! Look at that!

250
00:16:36,740 --> 00:16:37,740
We're taking on water!

251
00:16:37,900 --> 00:16:38,900
Repair the hole!

252
00:16:41,606 --> 00:16:42,692
The water stopped!

253
00:16:42,790 --> 00:16:44,280
The water stopped!

254
00:16:44,485 --> 00:16:46,360
Blood, what happened?

255
00:16:48,115 --> 00:16:51,548
Trim the sails! Hold fast! Rocks straight ahead!

256
00:16:52,762 --> 00:16:53,393
Look out!

257
00:16:53,480 --> 00:16:54,119
Blood!

258
00:16:58,519 --> 00:16:59,580
Are you okay, Sapphire?

259
00:16:59,800 --> 00:17:00,093
Yeah.

260
00:17:00,285 --> 00:17:01,693
But what happened?

261
00:17:04,180 --> 00:17:05,106
The Raging Rocks...

262
00:17:05,130 --> 00:17:06,240
What about the Raging Rocks?

263
00:17:06,349 --> 00:17:08,819
So, are we heading toward Black Cloud Island with the waterfall?

264
00:17:09,179 --> 00:17:12,020
Yeah, no matter what you say, I'm getting involved.

265
00:17:13,479 --> 00:17:14,900
Hey, don't dawdle!

266
00:17:15,174 --> 00:17:16,280
Water's rushing in!

267
00:17:20,640 --> 00:17:22,040
Sapphire, hold on!

268
00:17:28,239 --> 00:17:29,686
Hey, hard to starboard!

269
00:17:29,852 --> 00:17:31,214
Bare to right!

270
00:17:31,639 --> 00:17:33,380
Damn it!

271
00:17:49,696 --> 00:17:54,168
We're saved!

272
00:17:54,193 --> 00:17:55,659
We're saved!

273
00:17:55,820 --> 00:17:56,646
Well done!

274
00:17:57,500 --> 00:17:59,694
Some captain you are!

275
00:18:00,112 --> 00:18:01,833
Is Sapphire all you can see?!

276
00:18:02,135 --> 00:18:02,941
What did you say?

277
00:18:03,200 --> 00:18:05,946
If you don't pull yourself together, I fear for what lies ahead!

278
00:18:27,172 --> 00:18:29,240
Land ho!

279
00:18:29,320 --> 00:18:30,320
Sapphire, wake up!

280
00:18:30,424 --> 00:18:31,333
The island's coming into view!

281
00:18:44,720 --> 00:18:46,866
My head feels so fuzzy...

282
00:18:50,419 --> 00:18:51,946
It's a mermaid!

283
00:18:55,079 --> 00:18:57,013
It's getting to me, too...

284
00:19:00,205 --> 00:19:01,006
Get to the island!

285
00:19:01,185 --> 00:19:02,185
Don't be fooled!

286
00:19:02,394 --> 00:19:03,586
That song is the voice of a demon!

287
00:19:09,494 --> 00:19:11,760
Wait, my head's going crazy too...

288
00:19:33,540 --> 00:19:34,280
Sapphire...

289
00:19:40,319 --> 00:19:41,740
Sapphire, thank you.

290
00:19:41,959 --> 00:19:43,260
I've come back to my senses.

291
00:19:44,524 --> 00:19:46,293
Anyone who wants to be shark bait, go right ahead!

292
00:19:46,969 --> 00:19:48,913
Captain Blood has landed on Black Cloud Island!

293
00:19:50,029 --> 00:19:51,900
No way am I moving a muscle for a woman!

294
00:19:52,234 --> 00:19:53,920
That bastard... just wait and see!

295
00:19:54,294 --> 00:19:54,787
Wretch!

296
00:20:19,582 --> 00:20:22,613
Sapphire, this is Black Cloud Island, home of the Waterfall of Purification.

297
00:20:26,319 --> 00:20:28,580
Silver, you didn't need to bring that with you.

298
00:20:29,999 --> 00:20:31,919
You never know what might show up.

299
00:20:34,859 --> 00:20:37,933
Blood, I hear the sound of water over there...

300
00:20:41,820 --> 00:20:42,240
That's it!

301
00:20:42,699 --> 00:20:44,080
That's gotta be the Waterfall of Purification.

302
00:20:44,619 --> 00:20:46,060
Sapphire, the footing is treacherous.

303
00:20:46,300 --> 00:20:46,833
Go stand over there.

304
00:20:54,719 --> 00:20:56,253
Wash thoroughly to rinse out the poison.

305
00:21:05,980 --> 00:21:06,540
It's no good!

306
00:21:06,740 --> 00:21:07,213
It won't come out!

307
00:21:07,440 --> 00:21:08,440
It's just like before!

308
00:21:09,940 --> 00:21:10,940
Rinse them well!

309
00:21:11,344 --> 00:21:14,386
Let the water soak into your eyes and wash them carefully.

310
00:21:21,159 --> 00:21:22,147
How is it, Sapphire?

311
00:21:22,397 --> 00:21:23,425
Blood, watch out!

312
00:21:26,579 --> 00:21:28,480
Silver, you dare turn against me?

313
00:21:29,920 --> 00:21:32,080
I've been waiting a long time for this chance.

314
00:21:32,499 --> 00:21:33,540
Then no one will get in my way.

315
00:21:33,749 --> 00:21:35,040
Blood, here I come!

316
00:21:35,820 --> 00:21:36,140
I can see!

317
00:21:36,469 --> 00:21:37,540
My eyes... I can see again!

318
00:21:43,219 --> 00:21:44,413
Alright, come on!

319
00:21:44,660 --> 00:21:45,340
I'll take you on!

320
00:21:45,453 --> 00:21:45,826
Come on!

321
00:21:50,780 --> 00:21:51,600
Stop!

322
00:21:51,769 --> 00:21:52,933
Stop it, both of you!

323
00:22:06,113 --> 00:22:06,946
Wait!

324
00:22:08,169 --> 00:22:09,440
Now you're facing me!

325
00:22:12,145 --> 00:22:13,126
Impudent brat!

326
00:22:13,319 --> 00:22:15,160
I'll take care of you first!

327
00:22:15,233 --> 00:22:17,420
Prepare yourself!

328
00:22:40,669 --> 00:22:41,760
You're all alone!

329
00:22:41,940 --> 00:22:42,940
What are you going to do?

330
00:22:43,440 --> 00:22:44,080
F-F-F-F-Father!

331
00:22:44,359 --> 00:22:45,580
I give up!

332
00:22:45,769 --> 00:22:46,820
Father, it's me!

333
00:22:55,629 --> 00:22:56,629
Are you all right, Blood?

334
00:22:56,900 --> 00:22:57,340
Hold on!

335
00:22:57,600 --> 00:22:59,080
First, let me wash that wound.

336
00:22:59,345 --> 00:22:59,960
I'm fine.

337
00:23:00,104 --> 00:23:01,140
It's just a scratch.

338
00:23:01,444 --> 00:23:02,900
You're as strong as ever.

339
00:23:06,139 --> 00:23:10,180
But I like you better in a dress, like yesterday.

340
00:23:10,965 --> 00:23:12,184
Did you say something?

341
00:23:13,460 --> 00:23:14,460
No, nothing.

342
00:23:14,919 --> 00:23:16,540
Just that we should hurry back home.

343
00:23:17,839 --> 00:23:20,760
Still, I'm really glad you got your sight back.

344
00:23:23,194 --> 00:23:25,280
It's all thanks to you, Blood!

345
00:23:31,060 --> 00:23:32,060
Well then, Sapphire.

346
00:23:32,174 --> 00:23:33,840
Take care and stay strong.

347
00:23:33,960 --> 00:23:34,500
Okay?

348
00:23:34,560 --> 00:23:34,946
Yeah.

349
00:23:35,325 --> 00:23:36,325
Goodbye, Blood.

350
00:23:40,800 --> 00:23:41,493
Sapphire!

351
00:23:41,700 --> 00:23:42,280
Take care!

352
00:23:43,359 --> 00:23:44,646
Goodbye, Blood!

353
00:23:44,934 --> 00:23:46,399
Goodbye, everyone!

354
00:23:49,843 --> 00:23:52,303
Goodbye!

355
00:23:56,040 --> 00:23:57,040
Watch over me!

356
00:23:57,339 --> 00:24:00,860
I'll defeat the Snow Queen and protect Silverland!

357
00:24:02,719 --> 00:24:05,320
Father, Mother, please wait for me!

